\newlabel{tab:extreme-accuracy-best}{{3.4}{5}{Extreme world, unfiltered arms: the best of the three September repeats per recording, ``best'' being the lowest aligned ATE. Rotation, jump-free RPE and jump count are those of the selected run; the median and worst ATE of the three are kept beside the best so the selection is visible. Jump-free RPE excludes pairs spanning a step above \SI {10}{\metre \per \second }; the rotational figure is the median over pairs, because a single orientation step inflates the RMSE (\cref {sec:realistic-ab}).\relax }{table.caption.13}{}}
