\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {3.8}{\ignorespaces Extreme world, real-time and resource measurements: mean $\pm $ SD over the three September repeats per recording ($n$), with a pooled row per scene. Front-end and back-end are each run's median module latency (ORB-SLAM3: tracking and local mapping; VINS-Fusion: feature tracking and back-end optimisation); throughput is processed frames per second of sensor time; ``Kept'' the processed fraction of received frames; CPU is process time over wall time, in percent of one core; RSS the peak resident set. Replay rate $0.5\times $. The VINS-Fusion+YOLO rows are the September runs, in which the filter did not activate except on \texttt  {dynamic_00_000} repeat\nobreakspace  {}1 (re-run 15 October).\relax }}{18}{table.caption.30}\protected@file@percent }
