\newlabel{fig:realistic-traj}{{3.12}{20}{Unfiltered estimates on the four realistic-warehouse recordings after rigid $SE(3)$ alignment with scale fixed, on the warehouse footprint; black is ground truth. Top: the static twins; bottom: the same layouts with traffic. Dashed purple is ORB-SLAM3 with its loop closer disabled. The only visible departure is VINS-Fusion on \repo {realistic_002}.\relax }{figure.caption.39}{}}
\newlabel{fig:realistic-traj@cref}{{[figure][12][4]3.12}{[1][19][]20}}
