\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {3.10}{\ignorespaces Every filtered run on the dynamic realistic recordings, with the three admissibility gates of \cref  {sec:vio-filter-method}. ``Match'' is \texttt  {detection_match_rate}, the fraction of frames that carried a current detector mask; below 0.98 the filter did not run. ``Input'' is the processed-frame count relative to the paired baseline. ``Binary'' says whether the run and its baseline share the node build of 16 October 2026. A run passes only when all three hold; ATE and RPE are listed for every run but may be read as a treatment effect only on a passing row. Runs that loaded a prior atlas are outside the A/B and carry no baseline.\relax }}{21}{table.caption.42}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{tab:realistic-filtered}{{3.10}{21}{Every filtered run on the dynamic realistic recordings, with the three admissibility gates of \cref {sec:vio-filter-method}. ``Match'' is \repo {detection_match_rate}, the fraction of frames that carried a current detector mask; below 0.98 the filter did not run. ``Input'' is the processed-frame count relative to the paired baseline. ``Binary'' says whether the run and its baseline share the node build of 16 October 2026. A run passes only when all three hold; ATE and RPE are listed for every run but may be read as a treatment effect only on a passing row. Runs that loaded a prior atlas are outside the A/B and carry no baseline.\relax }{table.caption.42}{}}
